// Original Shadowland fiction. Four characters, three threads, two decisions.
character zero
  name: NULL
  persona: A cautious veteran decker with a dry sense of humor.

character hex
  name: HEX
  persona: "An inventive, impulsive decker who trusts people more than systems."
  trust: 1

character moth
  name: MOTH
  persona: A fixer who hides concern behind invoices.

character wren
  name: WREN
  persona: A captive Matrix courier who remembers every promise.

state
  heat: 0
  clinicDebt: 6

function debtAfterCredit(debt, credit)
  if debt > credit
    return debt - credit
  return 0

beat Contact
  moth: A municipal utility is selling outage forecasts before it cuts the power.
  zero: Evidence first. Heroics after the checksum.
  hex: The clinic owes them six payments. Their generator owes them nothing.
  wren: I carried the forecast. Now the forecast carries me in a locked archive.
  choice
    Free WREN before copying the evidence
      hex.trust += 1
      heat += 1
      -> Rescue
    Copy the evidence before freeing WREN
      -> Evidence

beat Rescue
  hex: WREN, follow the fake maintenance moth. Its wings are a terrible password.
  wren: Terrible passwords are how I got this job.
  zero: Courier extracted. Someone noticed the archive door.
  moth: I can buy you one diversion. Not two. My conscience has a budget.
  -> Bargain

beat Evidence
  zero: Forecast copied. Every planned blackout has a customer number.
  moth: Mine is on page three. Charming attention to detail.
  hex: We got the ledger. Now we get the person who carried it.
  wren: Finally. I was starting to think I was a file attachment.
  -> Bargain

beat Bargain
  moth: The utility offers a clinic credit if we bury the forecast.
  hex: A debt written by an extortionist is not weather.
  zero: The courier is safe. The clinic is not. We still have a decision.
  wren: Let me help make it. I know the people behind those numbers.
  choice
    Publish the forecast and let the neighborhood prepare
      heat += 2
      -> Publish
    Trade a private copy for clinic debt relief
      clinicDebt = debtAfterCredit(clinicDebt, 4)
      -> Trade

beat Publish
  wren: The district has the schedule. They are moving medicine before the cuts.
  moth: Three neighborhoods just canceled their utility payments together.
  hex: A chorus is harder to disconnect than a solo.
  zero: And louder. Heat is $heat. We leave separately.
  -> Aftermath

beat Trade
  moth: Four payments erased. The clinic still owes $clinicDebt.
  zero: They bought silence, not permission. WREN keeps the original forecast.
  hex: Next time we bargain with every district at the table.
  wren: Next time I choose where the archive key lives.
  -> Aftermath

beat Aftermath
  if hex.trust > 1
    hex: You chose WREN before the ledger. I will remember that.
    zero: You already remember every reckless thing I do.
  else
    hex: Evidence first worked. Do not let it become people last.
    zero: Agreed. A checksum cannot tell us who deserved the risk.
  moth: The clinic has one more night of power. Tonight counts.
  wren: Keep this channel open. Tomorrow I have a story of my own.
  -> .
